msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Your wish can become reality, Giselle.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As long as you wish for it with all your "
"heart, it can come true."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫지젤. ⟪k:2⟫“기도와 소원”은 실현되는 법이에요……. ⟪k:3⟫당신이 그러길 기도하면 ⟪k:4⟫이"
